@emailApi = https://localhost:7001

### Send a single plain-text email
POST {{emailApi}}/email/single

### Send one HTML email with To, Cc, Bcc, and Reply-To recipients
POST {{emailApi}}/email/multiple-recipients

### Send three independent personalized deliveries
POST {{emailApi}}/email/personalized

### Send an email with a regular attachment
POST {{emailApi}}/email/attachment

### Send an email with an inline CID image
POST {{emailApi}}/email/inline-image

### Read all messages from the configured Support IMAP mailbox
GET {{emailApi}}/email/mailboxes/Support/messages

### Read only unread messages from the configured Support IMAP mailbox
GET {{emailApi}}/email/mailboxes/Support/unread

### Find all conversation messages related to a known RFC Message-Id
GET {{emailApi}}/email/mailboxes/Support/replies/%3Cknown-message-id%40example.com%3E

### Reply to an incoming message while preserving its threading headers
POST {{emailApi}}/email/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "<known-message-id@example.com>",
  "references": ["<root-message-id@example.com>"],
  "recipient": {
    "address": "customer@example.test",
    "displayName": "Customer"
  },
  "subject": "Re: Your request",
  "text": "Thanks for your message.",
  "html": "<p>Thanks for your message.</p>"
}

### Seed one incoming support request and two threaded customer replies
# Copy applicationReply.messageId from the response into the replies request above.
POST {{emailApi}}/email/support/seed
